			"height": 150,
			"color": "6",
			"text": "# CB2203 Final\nThu 10 Dec · 09:30 · 50%\n2 h · closed book · MCQ (incl. Excel output reading) + long questions"
		},
		{
			"id": "1a7e3998669f42e1",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -1120,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 332,
			"label": "LP (L1–L3)"
		},
		{
			"id": "1d5d6fbcf7be4c2b",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1100,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D01**\nLP formulation / Solver\n\nDecision variables → objective → constraints → Solver (Simplex LP, non-negative)."
		},
		{
			"id": "be4fd6bb3e094827",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1100,
			"y": 176,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D02**\nSensitivity analysis\n\nShadow price, reduced cost, allowable increase/decrease; read the Sensitivity Report."
		},
		{
			"id": "eeeb9d1ecaac4da4",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -660,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 332,
			"label": "IP / NLP (L5–L7)"
		},
		{
			"id": "e4d54d54d7e4476d",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -640,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D03**\nInteger programming\n\nInteger/binary constraints, either-or, fixed cost, logical conditions."
		},
		{
			"id": "31f8164070a64830",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -640,
			"y": 176,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D04**\nNon-linear programming\n\nGRG Nonlinear, starting values, local vs global optimum."
		},
		{
			"id": "7a368f6bf87a4a4b",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 196,
			"label": "Simulation (L8–L10)"
		},
		{
			"id": "35f65ccf2b014ea7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D05**\nSimulation (Monte Carlo / newsvendor / queueing / overbooking)\n\nRAND/VLOOKUP/NORM.INV set-up; read the output table; decide from averages."
		},
		{
			"id": "a25454e38b084915",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 260,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 196,
			"label": "Regression (L11–L12)"
		},
		{
			"id": "ff40c52ac2b44da0",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 280,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D06**\nRegression / ANOVA\n\nRead R², ANOVA F + significance F, coefficient p-values; interpret."
		},
		{
			"id": "5095ff1c799c4ca2",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 720,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 332,
			"label": "Exam skills"
		},
		{
			"id": "0b038167957b4bff",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D07**\nExcel-input fill-ins\n\nWrite the exact cell formula / Solver entry for each blank."
		},
		{
			"id": "ca8ab6ef1f07432e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 176,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "**D08**\nMCQ output reading\n\nAnswer/Sensitivity/regression output → MCQ in < 1.5 min."
		},
		{
			"id": "9ee85bd2d7614d29",
			"type": "text",
